    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在引導學生認識與實踐精實企業轉型所需之核心觀念與方法。內容涵蓋精實生產的基礎理論與個案研討。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is designed to guide students in understanding and applying the core concepts and methods required for lean enterprise transformation. The content covers the fundamental theories of lean production as well as case studies.",
